  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239acf8f6928425d5c311/step-fbd4d400.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut pumpkin and potato into bite-sized chunks.\n• Pick and finely chop rosemary.\n• Place rosemary, pumpkin and potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239acf8f6928425d5c311/step-69f36f10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim green beans. Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239acf8f6928425d5c311/step-0ac52920.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 10 minutes remaining, boil the kettle.\n• In a large frying pan, heat the butter and a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook green beans, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and silverbeet and cook, until fragrant and wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239acf8f6928425d5c311/step-a4fb0b30.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine gravy granules, the boiling water (1/2 cup for 2 people / 1 cup for 4 people) and brisket juices, whisking, until smooth, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239acf8f6928425d5c311/step-6d7aff40.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide plant-based crumbed chicken, garlic greens, pumpkin and potato between plates.\n• Pour over gravy to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67e239acf8f6928425d5c311/step-31af6f50.jpeg"
    }
  ]
